WEBVTT

00:05:28.667 --> 00:05:33.184
Caused by the powerful
and nefarious forces

00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:35.684
of the overmighty state,

00:05:35.708 --> 00:05:40.434
whose collectivizing tendencies
crush freedom and individualism

00:05:40.458 --> 00:05:42.101
and opportunity.

00:05:42.125 --> 00:05:45.309
But the hero of the story,
the entrepreneur,

00:05:45.333 --> 00:05:48.601
will fight those powerful forces,

00:05:48.625 --> 00:05:50.309
roll back the state,

00:05:50.333 --> 00:05:53.601
and through creating
wealth and opportunity,

00:05:53.625 --> 00:05:56.893
restore harmony to the land.

00:05:56.917 --> 00:06:01.518
And that story also resonated
across the political spectrum.